## Verified capabilities (the only things a script may claim)
1. **Configurator widget for the dealer's own website**, pasted with one iFrame snippet, brandable (colours, font, logo), white-label on
   higher plans; the visitor chooses the window (material, glass, colours, sizes, opening) and sees the price.
2. **Requests arrive complete** in the platform ("Richieste"), with spam/price-shopper filtering ("filtra chi non è cliente vero").
3. **Price list from CSV**, standard price list by zone (North/Centre/South) for PVC profiles, adjustable margin with a slider, VAT shown
   on top, always live on every site where the widget is installed.
4. **Showroom configurator** for the team: instant quote with VAT.
5. **B2B quotes** with technical drawing (SVG, opening direction, handle position), PDF export, **digital signature**, draft/send/win states.
6. **Two-colour (bicolore) windows**: outside finish different from inside, priced and drawn correctly. Textured finishes with swatches.
7. **CRM-style back office**: clients, job sites ("cantieri"), **leads import** from Excel/CSV/Word, site surveys ("rilievi"),
   installation dossiers (UNI 11673 workflow), acceptance tests ("collaudi"), QR passports, supply and logistics, net-profit analytics.
8. **Works on phone, tablet and desktop**; installable to the home screen; mobile bottom bar.
9. **Security basics**: verified registration (age check, DPA signed in sign-up), verified uploads, signed webhooks.
10. **Referral programme** ("Invita e risparmia") exists; check current rules before mentioning any reward.
Anything else (integrations, AI features, accounting links, native apps) is **not** verified: do not claim it.

